WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:03.100
- On behalf of Netflix Geeked,

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.840
welcome all humans, dwarfs, and halflings,

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.380
specially you creatures at home,

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.060
who are "Stranger Things"
super fans like me.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:12.610
You're in for a special Geeked Week treat.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:16.680
Today, I'm sitting down with
The Hellfire Club themselves

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.470
for a one of a kind Dungeons
and Dragons adventure.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:22.020
I'm your host and dungeon
master, B Dave Walters.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.890
And the adventurers joining
me on today's quest?

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:27.400
None other than Finn
Wolfhard, Pria Ferguson,

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.650
Gaten Matarazzo, and Joe Quinn.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.393
- The hooded cultists chant.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.257
Hail, Lord Veckna.

00:00:38.995 --> 00:00:39.828
- Veckna's dead.

00:00:39.828 --> 00:00:40.661
- He took my cat.

00:00:40.661 --> 00:00:44.160
- So it was thought, my
friends. So it was thought.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.821
But Veckna lives.

00:00:45.821 --> 00:00:48.321
(tense music)

00:01:01.070 --> 00:01:04.023
- Today was supposed to be a good day.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.620
After years of grand adventuring,

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:10.963
you're returning home to Hawks End.

00:01:12.110 --> 00:01:14.450
Each of you has made your
way through the world,

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.920
carving your legend into history.

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:21.450
Goblins, giants, ogres, trolls, dragons,

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:25.150
all manner of monsters
have fallen before you.

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:29.150
Again and again, you've
won, cheating death itself.

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:32.223
And today, death has come to collect.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:36.993
Our heroes, Pardonme Belchin,

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:43.160
Joe Keery, Chad Handstand,
and Lady Applejack.

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:48.160
You see home in the distance.

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:51.450
Hawks End is a small, beautiful town.

00:01:51.450 --> 00:01:54.740
It sits on a little island
in the middle of the river,

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:57.240
as the water flows around it on all sides,

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.400
creating kind of a natural boundary.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.790
There's only two ways in,

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:03.510
a bridge to the North,
and a bridge to the South,

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:07.371
surrounded on all sides
by luscious forest.

00:02:07.371 --> 00:02:10.770
As you see home in the
distance, you can already catch

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:14.460
the smell of baking bread
wafting on the wind.

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:17.020
You hear children laughing
off in the distance,

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:20.230
and can see the smoke stacks rising

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:22.563
out of familiar sites of home.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:27.770
Just north of Hawk's End,
there's a ranger station,

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:29.810
a guard post that you have to check in,

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:33.523
as you four heroes come walking up.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:35.990
What would you like to do?

00:02:38.072 --> 00:02:39.240
- Ooh, fun.

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:41.470
And it begins.
- Who starts?

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.430
- Whoever would like.

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:45.360
You all, the four of you
are walking down the road.

00:02:45.360 --> 00:02:46.795
- I'm assuming we have
passports and stuff,

00:02:46.795 --> 00:02:48.720
the documentation to get on through.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:50.923
So I guess we're gonna go
up to the ranger station.

00:02:52.836 --> 00:02:54.715
I don't really seem to have
a lot of charisma here,

00:02:54.715 --> 00:02:56.765
but I'm gonna be like, can I get through?

00:02:58.520 --> 00:02:59.870
- Important question here.

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:04.086
What does Pardonme Belchin
look like? Who is he?

00:03:04.086 --> 00:03:06.800
- Pardonme Belching, he's a smelly dude.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:08.520
I mean, he has to kind of like.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.470
It wasn't his given name,
but he came up with it

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:11.770
later in life and thought that it would be

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:14.370
a good thing to just set the boundaries

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:16.633
of what interacting
with him might be like.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:21.600
So, smelly dude. He's not the brightest.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.740
At least people around
him don't think he is.

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:25.950
And he is kind of accepted that
throughout most of his days.

00:03:25.950 --> 00:03:28.620
But he enjoys an adventure.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:32.190
He enjoys a good bar fight, I'd say.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:37.130
And he, above all else, enjoys family.

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:39.800
- And you're a dwarven grave cleric.

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:42.473
- Yeah, so he's a morbid one.

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.180
Some would say it's a sense of humor.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.090
Some would say it's just weird.

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:49.570
- As you call out down the road,

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:53.910
from inside the booth,
all of you hear (grunting)

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:58.873
You four back again, huh?

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:06.440
And a head leans out, a familiar
head that you've all seen,

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:11.170
