00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.660
But honestly the comparison
would be a little offensive,

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:26.300
and you and Gloom have never really

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:28.630
gotten along because of this.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:32.037
He has black hair that
is knotted and kinked,

00:04:32.037 --> 00:04:33.920
