00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.720
Because he's never overly
concerned with his appearance.

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:42.330
Thought you all were off becoming legends.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:45.580
I hear the stories all the time of oh,

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:49.090
Chad Handstand held a handstand.

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:50.763
Whatever. Who cares?

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:53.663
Why you back?

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:58.040
- Hungry, tired.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.623
- Tired. Supplies, do we need supplies?

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.050
