00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.170
Great chat, wicked sense of humor.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:22.560
Although, apparently he's got
no charisma or intelligence,

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:26.540
which is kind of interesting.

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:28.090
- You speak a different language.

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:29.070
- [Joe] Kind of thing.

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:33.233
- Now you're a cat person. So
what does your fur look like?

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:36.513
- What would Joe Keery's fur look like?

00:05:36.513 --> 00:05:38.162
Just perfect.

00:05:38.162 --> 00:05:39.370
- That's more wicked.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:42.400
- Yeah, it just looks just right.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.233
