00:05:43.233 --> 00:05:46.750
- Kind of brown, kind of mousey.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:49.790
But kind of oily, but
kind of not too oily.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:52.343
Kind of, it just looks nice.

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:57.640
- And what does Lady Applejack look like?

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.921
- She's an elf.

00:05:58.921 --> 00:06:00.145
(all laughing)

00:06:00.145 --> 00:06:01.025
- [Finn] You are an elf.

00:06:01.025 --> 00:06:03.800
- [Dave] Assassin rogue,
the most dangerous.

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:06.033
Yeah, the most dangerous.

00:06:08.011 --> 00:06:09.443
It says dark elf, so the dark elf.

00:06:11.526 --> 00:06:13.100
She's very sneaky.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:13.933
- [Dave] Perfect.

00:06:13.933 --> 00:06:15.689
- [Finn] Yeah, I think
she's killing it actually.

00:06:15.689 --> 00:06:17.649
'Cause she doesn't wanna
give too much away.

00:06:17.649 --> 00:06:19.150
- It's perfect. You say, you'll find out.

00:06:19.150 --> 00:06:20.490
- [Finn] She doesn't
wanna give too much away.

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:22.457
- Last, but certainly not
least, Chad Handstand.

00:06:22.457 --> 00:06:24.270
What does he look like?

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.683
- Well, he.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:31.981
He's not the most strong
guy in the world, but he is.

00:06:31.981 --> 00:06:33.380
He's got some.

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:36.263
He's pretty, he's pretty big. Yeah, no.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:39.900
But he's kinda like the skinny strong.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:43.420
He's not super max out or
anything, but he's like.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.030
He's like a Robert Pattinson kind of type.

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:47.773
But, in that kind of way.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:50.470
Scrawny, yet strong.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:54.340
- Now you are a human
paladin, but you, while you.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:59.270
What you were lacking in
charisma, Joe, Chad took all of.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.223
- Chad took all of that.

00:07:00.223 --> 00:07:01.160
- He's beautiful.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.960
The wind is always blowing
perfectly in his hair.

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:06.314
The sun is always hitting him, just right.

00:07:06.314 --> 00:07:07.680
- That's so true, yeah.

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.672
He got the name Chad
Handstand though because

00:07:09.672 --> 00:07:12.102
he was at a funeral and
everyone was crying.

00:07:12.102 --> 00:07:12.935
