00:07:12.935 --> 00:07:14.883
- And to cheer everyone
up, he said, watch this.

00:07:15.820 --> 00:07:17.137
In hindsight it might
have made everything-

00:07:17.137 --> 00:07:18.110
- Inappropriate.
- Yeah, in appropriate.

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:19.550
It might have made everything about him.

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.740
But he still did the handstand.

00:07:20.740 --> 00:07:23.960
And from that point on, he
was known as Chad Handstand.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.720
- Did it kill? Did people like it?

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.743
- Well, technically it killed
it. It was at a funeral.

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:32.550
No, it didn't kill. No one
liked it. But he kept that.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.750
And from that moment on he
kind of, he just became.

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:37.990
