your way into town, I guess.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:20.460
Astara, she's at city hall.
She'll explain it all to you.

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:23.870
Just do what you're gonna
do, and get outta here soon.

00:08:23.870 --> 00:08:25.603
The town's better off without you.

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:27.623
- This guy.

00:08:27.623 --> 00:08:29.479
