00:08:34.311 --> 00:08:36.187
- Astara.
- Astara, all right.

00:08:36.187 --> 00:08:37.574
We've gotta go and see Astara, then.

00:08:37.574 --> 00:08:42.390
- You all know Astara. She is in elf.

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:45.050
She has been in charge all of your lives,

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.940
