00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:25.210
(grunting)

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:28.690
He goes and slams the door again.

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:31.620
And ahead of you stands the bridge

00:09:31.620 --> 00:09:34.303
to cross over into Hawks End.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:37.568
- So we should probably cross over that.

00:09:37.568 --> 00:09:39.424
- Let's cross over that bridge.

00:09:39.424 --> 00:09:42.460
