00:10:25.765 --> 00:10:28.337
- Dad, the beard is off!

00:10:28.337 --> 00:10:30.941
And the kid turns and
runs back into the house.

00:10:30.941 --> 00:10:31.774
- The beard was off.

00:10:31.774 --> 00:10:34.103
- The beard was off.
Listen, it's totally fine.

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:38.493
You put him in his place. Totally fine.

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:42.950
